zippy (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Harden ZIP and TAR extraction against unsafe archive members.
  * Make archive creation and ZIP repair replacements atomic.
  * Fix standalone configuration loading and exclude stored passwords.
  * Perform complete integrity reads for stream-compressed files.
  * Ship the default password dictionary in Python distributions.
  * Consolidate release automation and add continuous validation.

 -- John Hauger Mitander <john@on1.no>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200

